  "content": "<p>一款基於Fabric框架的模組，透過<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式傳送門</a>技術實現傳送槍功能。</p><p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/mxdDAr76Y3RwV9B.png\" alt=\"portal_gun.png\"></p><p>需安裝<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式傳送門模組</a>（至少2.5.2版本）。</p><p>需搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib4</a>（注意：須使用4.x.x版，非3.x.x版）。</p><p>合成配方：</p><p><img src=\"https://s2.loli.net/2023/03/19/qz5fNVnZCgytJUX.png\" alt=\"portal_gun_recipe.png\"></p><p>本模組改編自已停止開發的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/portal-gun-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">MeowMC傳送槍模組</a>。</p><p>Discord社群：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/BZxgURK\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/BZxgURK</a></p>",
